ew Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"AR-SA\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">مراعاة عنصر الوقت في عملية التوفيق بين الحسابات</span><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align: right; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; background: white; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .5in 5.0pt 0in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"AR-SA\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">إدخال البيانات الرئيسية للمعاملات المالية في قاعدة البيانات بشكل يومي</span><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">.</span></p>', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-07', 4, 3, 3, 5, 7, 1, 4, '...', NULL, 'الرياض', '2021-10-07 15