 minor-bidi;\">التأكد من عدم وجود فواتير متأخرة يجب تسجيلها محاسبياً وإن وجدت يجب متابعتها مع الموردين والحصول عليها</span><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"> .</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: right; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .5in 8.0pt 0in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">مطابقة فواتير المورد مع استلامات المخازن و أوامر الشراء الصادرة من إدارة المواد</span><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"> .</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: right; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .5in 8.0pt 0in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-font